          "settings": {
            "heading": "What cookies are",
            "text": "<p>Cookies are small text files a website stores in your browser. Some are needed for the shop to work at all; others help us understand how the shop is used, or measure our advertising. Similar technologies, such as pixels and local storage, work in much the same way, and this page covers them too.</p>"
          }
